# LOOM-8 demo: ambient, 64 BPM, D major. The synth engines and the kit's models only (no samples: publishable).
# (Rendered by loom_host directly: it has no bank.)
#   T1 kit: barely there (a low kick on the one, a shaker breathing, the string model now and then)
#   T2 organ "chapel": the chords, a soft pipe, dark   T3 voile "ninon": the choir above them, a bar a note
#   T4 swarm "angora": a theremin, four notes in four bars   T5 tines "lullaby": a music box, sparse
#   T6 organ "pedal bass": the 16' under it all
# Chords, a bar each: Dmaj9 | Bm11 | Gmaj7#11 | Asus. The music box and the theremin keep to D major's pentatonic,
# so a weave's notes fit any bar. Everything dark (low-passed, the master's top down) and into a long hall.
# Weaves (set up on each track's ARP, played on the WEAVE track, here written onto its steps as REC writes them):
#   T5 with its P2 by notes: P2's rhythm, P1's notes; T1 with its P2 by steps (a step of each in turn).
# Song: intro 4 (organ, choir), rise 4 (+ bells, pedal), full 4 (+ pulse, theremin; the bells woven, the pulse
# the last two bars), outro 4 (organ, choir, bells woven; an echo throw on the bells, the organ closing).
master 4096
bpm 64

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the kit, soft: the kick low and long, the shaker quiet, the string model plucked on A, all low-passed
knob 1 d1.k1 66
knob 1 d1.k2 80
knob 1 d1.k3 20
knob 1 d1.k4 20
knob 1 d1.volume 62
knob 1 d9.k2 70
knob 1 d9.volume 44
knob 1 d10.k1 46
knob 1 d10.k2 110
knob 1 d10.volume 56
knob 1 ftype lp12
knob 1 cut 70
knob 1 level 80
knob 1 send1 24
knob 1 send2 70
# T2 organ "chapel": the chords, a soft pipe, dark, into the hall
preset 2 church bellows
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 cut 66
knob 2 level 88
knob 2 send2 96
# T3 voile "ninon": the soprano choir, dark, back and wet
preset 3 ooh_choir voile
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 cut 62
knob 3 level 78
knob 3 send2 110
# T4 swarm "angora": the theremin, dark, the echo and the hall
preset 4 soft_lead knit
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 cut 60
knob 4 level 84
knob 4 send1 60
knob 4 send2 90
# T5 tines "lullaby": the music box, softened, far away
preset 5 glass_bell rayon
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 cut 58
knob 5 level 82
knob 5 send1 56
knob 5 send2 100
# T6 organ "pedal bass": the 16'
preset 6 organ_bass bellows
# (the song was written before a bass preset sat an octave down)
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 level 90
knob 6 send2 30
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, long and dark; FX II the hall: the largest, a long decay, its top damped
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 85
knob 11 e3 88
knob 11 e4 36
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e1 127
knob 12 e2 122
knob 12 e3 44
knob 12 e4 80
# the master: the top down, the compressor gentle
mst hi 46
mst comp 36
mst level 90

# ---- T1 the pulse: kick 1, shaker 9, string 10
# P1 the kick on the one, the shaker on beat 3, the string once
pat 1 1 16
hits 1 1 1 o...............
hits 1 1 9 ........g.......
hits 1 1 10 ......g.........
# P2 woven step by step with P1: the kick again late, the string twice
pat 1 2 16
hits 1 2 1 ..........g.....
hits 1 2 9 ....g...........
hits 1 2 10 .......g......g.

# ---- T2 the organ: Dmaj9 | Bm11 | Gmaj7#11 | Asus
pat 2 1 64
notes 2 1 1 16 84 D3 F#3 A3 E4
notes 2 1 17 16 84 B2 D3 A3 E4
notes 2 1 33 16 84 G2 B2 F#3 C#4
notes 2 1 49 16 84 A2 D3 E3 B3

# ---- T3 the choir: one note a bar, its top
pat 3 1 64
notes 3 1 1 15 80 A4
notes 3 1 17 15 76 F#4
notes 3 1 33 15 80 B4
notes 3 1 49 15 76 E4

# ---- T4 the theremin: four notes in four bars
pat 4 1 64
notes 4 1 5 10 92 A4
notes 4 1 21 8 88 F#4
notes 4 1 37 10 92 E5
notes 4 1 53 9 88 B4

# ---- T5 the music box. P1 a note on beats 1 and 3, now and then a pickup
pat 5 1 64
notes 5 1 1 2 80 D5
notes 5 1 9 2 66 A4
notes 5 1 17 2 78 B4
notes 5 1 25 2 64 F#4
notes 5 1 31 1 54 A4
notes 5 1 33 2 80 B4
notes 5 1 41 2 66 F#5
notes 5 1 49 2 78 A4
notes 5 1 57 2 64 E5
# P2 a slow rhythm across the bar (every sixth sixteenth): woven by notes it plays this rhythm with P1's notes
pat 5 2 16
notes 5 2 1 2 80 A5
notes 5 2 7 2 66 E5
notes 5 2 13 2 72 B5

# ---- T6 the pedal: the roots, long
pat 6 1 64
notes 6 1 1 15 90 D2
notes 6 1 17 15 90 B1
notes 6 1 33 15 90 G1
notes 6 1 49 15 90 A1

# ---- the weaves, set up (each track's ARP, Weave page): T5 with T5's P2 by notes, T1 with T1's P2 by steps
weaveset 5 5 2 notes
weaveset 1 1 2 steps
# the WEAVE track, as recorded: P1 empty; P2 the bells woven the four bars, the pulse the last two; P3 the bells,
# the outro's first two bars
wvpat 1 16
wvpat 2 64
wvstep 2 1 5 64
wvstep 2 33 1 32
wvpat 3 64
wvstep 3 1 5 32

# ---- scenes and the song (the mask: T1..T8, COND, THROW; x = muted)
scenedef 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 x..xxxxx
sceneweave 1 1
scenedef 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 2 x..x..xx
sceneweave 2 1
scenedef 3 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 3 ......xx
sceneweave 3 2
scenedef 4 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 4 x..x.xxx
sceneweave 4 3
song 1:4 2:4 3:4 4:4
songloop 0

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY), and perform
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav loom_demo_ambient.wav
tap PLAY
# intro, rise, full: as written
bars 12
# outro: the organ's cutoff closing over four bars; the bells thrown into the echo for the last two
knob 2 cut 58
bars 1
knob 2 cut 50
bars 1
knob 2 cut 42
throw echo on mel 5
bars 1
knob 2 cut 34
bars 1
throw echo off mel 5
wait 12000
wavstop
stats
